    "sentence_translations": [
      "What is “a quarter”?",
      "",
      "Ben: What time is it now?",
      "",
      "Little Yu: Ten and a quarter.",
      "",
      "Ben: A quarter? What is “a quarter”?",
      "",
      "Little Yu: A quarter is 15 minutes. “Ten and a quarter” means “10:15”.",
      "",
      "Ben: I understand.",
      "",
      "(30 minutes later)",
      "",
      "Ben: Little Yu, now it’s ten and three quarters, let’s go!",
      "",
      "Little Yu: Three quarters?",
      "",
      "Ben: Yes! Didn't you say that “a quarter” is “15 minutes”?",
      "Right now it’s 10:45, and that’s “ten and three quarters”, or isn’t it?",
      "",
      "Little Yu: Ben, we very rarely say “three quarters”.",
      "For 10:15 we say “ten and a quarter”, for 10:30 we say “ten and a half”.",
      "And for 10:45 we can say “a quarter short of eleven”.",
      "",
      "Ben: Ah, I understand. Now it’s a quarter short of eleven. Let’s go!",
      "",
      "Little Yu: Ok!",
      ""
